     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>How to plot the multi-variable linear regression line using the ggplot?</div><div>I tried adding interaction terms to x value, it doesn&#39;t seem to work!</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you!</div><div><br></div><div>Best regards</div><div>Anil</div><div><br></div></div>"
