     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Interaction terms transform one model into another model depending on group/level, so really you want to look at multiple lines/graphs with that approach. The advice already given should help you with that. You could also look at whether you need that level of complexity in your model i.e removing variables.</div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
